<h2>Against the wealthy thunder lords</h2>
<p>It is your job as the true Nimbian protector to destroy the powerfull Thunder lords! Also keep in mind that this is my beta version
If you find any bugs then you can go ahead and fix them. I know you have better knowledge in this than I do.
Please send your comments and opinions to me. Enjoy my tiny campaign...
<p>~[Inugget.4]<i>Alex Tatarov</i> - <a href="mailto:tatarovo@cadvision.com">tatarovo@cadvision.com</a>

